<title>POLAND: ZASADA MAY NET RISES TO PLN 8.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZASADA MAY NET RISES TO PLN 8.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.56 vs   2.20</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.76 vs   3.67</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.85 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Sales		   86.80 vs  17.57</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.33 vs   2.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	17.43 vs   5.78</p>
<p> Operating profit    10.29 vs   6.45</p>
<p> Sales		  285.72 vs 149.92</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish automotive group is Sobieslaw</p>
<p>Zasada Centrum SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
